OL,3,AGovernment making up China policy as it
OL,4,Agoes along, say MPs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has failed to deliver on
OL,7,Fits promise to pursue a consistent
OL,8,Fapproach towards China and is instead
OL,9,Fmaking up policy "as it goes along",
OL,10,FMPs on the business committee have
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FThe committee said in its report that
OL,14,Fdecision-making had been characterised
OL,15,Fby "inconsistency" and was heightening
OL,16,Fnational security risks.
OL,18,FIt called on ministers to block the
OL,19,Ftransfer of sensitive data to China,
OL,20,Fgive businesses clear rules for doing
OL,21,Ftrade with the super power and ban
OL,22,Fimports made using forced labour.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
