OL,3,AGovernment making up China policy as it
OL,4,Agoes along, say MPs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe business department said it
OL,7,Fdisagreed with the report's conclusion
OL,8,Fadding: "Our approach to China is
OL,9,Fconsistent - we will co-operate where
OL,10,Fwe can and challenge where we must."
